{"title":"a web world born in love","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/a-web-world-born-in-love","date":1742307000000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d2a151d4-0b1a-417a-bdde-2c43859327b3/3.13.25.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"2048\" height=\"2048\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d2a151d4-0b1a-417a-bdde-2c43859327b3/3.13.25.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d2a151d4-0b1a-417a-bdde-2c43859327b3/3.13.25.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d2a151d4-0b1a-417a-bdde-2c43859327b3/3.13.25.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d2a151d4-0b1a-417a-bdde-2c43859327b3/3.13.25.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d2a151d4-0b1a-417a-bdde-2c43859327b3/3.13.25.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d2a151d4-0b1a-417a-bdde-2c43859327b3/3.13.25.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d2a151d4-0b1a-417a-bdde-2c43859327b3/3.13.25.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><em>this is my weekly </em><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-diaries\"><em>visual diaries</em></a><em>, in which I distill my week through my hands &amp; vision.</em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n  <p><em>on valentine’s day, I completed the first iteration of </em><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/the-birth-of-otherworldly\" target=\"_blank\"><em>otherworldly</em></a><em> — and it felt like holding the seed of many new worlds. simultaneously a point of arrival and departure. K made fried anchovies and chocolate souffle for dinner, and complained as to why I was still working…</em></p><p>*</p><p>*</p><p>*</p><p>when I drew this, I was backlogged on visual diaries by a month. the last visual diaries (<a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/the-board-game-of-turkish-bureaucracy\" target=\"_blank\">board game</a>) took so much energy out of me — probably because of how detail oriented I had to be. meticulous detail is both my superpower <em>and</em> the bane of my existence. when I get started, it’s hard to stop. </p><p>I’m starting to put time boundaries on my weekly diaries. and I realized that trying to distill a week’s worth of events is hard. from now on, I’m going to focus on capturing a single moment. I showed otherworldly to my friend Marie shortly after it was born, and she said — <em>born in love</em>. hence the title of this post. </p><p></p><p><em>*otherworldly was born 10:13 pm, February 14th 2025, in Istanbul, Turkey.<br /><br /><br /></em></p><h1>the first sketch</h1>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a5a45497-a8fa-436b-8a06-1301747cd630/sketch.png?format=1000w\" width=\"2128\" height=\"2128\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a5a45497-a8fa-436b-8a06-1301747cd630/sketch.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a5a45497-a8fa-436b-8a06-1301747cd630/sketch.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a5a45497-a8fa-436b-8a06-1301747cd630/sketch.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a5a45497-a8fa-436b-8a06-1301747cd630/sketch.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a5a45497-a8fa-436b-8a06-1301747cd630/sketch.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a5a45497-a8fa-436b-8a06-1301747cd630/sketch.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a5a45497-a8fa-436b-8a06-1301747cd630/sketch.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <h1>notes on process</h1><p>a lot of things happened that week — including a major client deadline which felt like having wasps fly around my head (previously, it was a <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/leviathan-hydra-monster\" target=\"_blank\">leviathan</a>). </p><p>I wanted to draw that experience into this image as well. but, because part of this diaries practice is <em>visual distillation</em>, instead, I decided to prioritize the birth of otherworldly — so that this image could be minimalist, cosmic, and beautiful. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n           